## Limitations
Curriculum and ASVAB components absent from the file (academic block is a 2-variable proxy); 2.69% BA
prevalence is implausibly low for NLS and the file may not be the exact version behind the metadata
numbers; cross-sectional data so "mediation" is statistical adjustment, not a causal claim; race dummy
coefficients flip sign in the fully adjusted model (suppression by family size), so only the reference-free
2-df block test is a stable summary of the race effect.
